      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w18.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "号外が、朝の街に、ばさばさと何枚も舞った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見出しは「世界滅亡ショー、初日決定——最終週」日付を、三度読んだ。うちの決勝と、同じ日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同じ、時刻。耳が、ぴんと立った。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "酔いの本音は、当たってた。ぞわり、と鳥肌が立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社は、目玉の再演を、うちの新作の真上に落としてきた。狙いは、誰の目にも丸見え。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "客の取り合い。決勝の客席を、まるごと空にするための日付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街は、悲鳴を上げた。両方観たい人の悲鳴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「体は一つなんだぞ!」と、雑踏の中で誰かが叫んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ガヤ氏が、号外の前で頭を抱えてうずくまった。実況の体も、一つしかないのに。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "控室の空気は、怒りじゃなかった。むしろ、火が入った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「客の取り合いなら、興行の正面勝負じゃないか」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「面白くなってきた」と、誰かが楽しそうに笑った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの面々は、こういう時に頼もしすぎる。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "冷静に、頭だけで読めば、これは会社の白状だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "わざわざ同日にぶつけるのは、うちの決勝を、放っておけない脅威と認めたから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "恐れられてるなら、上等。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方の受付には、もう長い先約の列ができていた。先頭は、白ひげの剣士さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「決勝の席を、いま予約できんかの」当日券のみです、と答えると、彼は頷いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「なら、当日、いちばんに並ぶ」列は、閉店まで途切れなかった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただ、一つだけ、どうにも、不気味なことがある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決勝の対戦カードだけが、いまだに発表されない。掲示板の相手欄には、ただ一言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w18.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「調整中」……会社が調整する決勝の相手って、誰。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w18.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
